  "description": "Wire-shape data for Lyo.Authentication: records returned over the API (`LyoUser`, `LinkedIdentity`, `IssuedLyoJwt`, `IssuedApiToken`, `ApiTokenRecord`, `ApiTokenPrincipal`, `ApiTokenIssueRequest`), JWT claim-name constants, the Lyo JWT parser, Format-B token format helpers (`Base64Url`, `Base32Crockford`, `ApiToken`, `ApiTokenKind`, `ApiTokenRing`), audit-event taxonomy (`AuthAuditEvent`, `AuthAuditEventKind`), and the `Scope` record. Safe to reference from consumer-side libraries — including Blazor WebAssembly clients — because it carries no server-side issuers / validators / stores and depends on neither `Lyo.KeyStore`, `Lyo.Hashing`, nor BouncyCastle.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
